1853
01:23:46,055 --> 01:23:47,390
Uh-huh.
Cuckoo.

1854
01:23:47,390 --> 01:23:48,724
Undoubtedly, 
 to detect weaknesses

1855
01:23:48,724 --> 01:23:49,892
