not a graphic novel."

2000
01:29:31,233 --> 01:29:33,068
Superman's dead.

2001
01:29:33,068 --> 01:29:36,905
He also says,
"PS, the robot in
the picture is 2XL,

2002
01:29:36,905 --> 01:29:38,641
and can I be
on your show? "

2003
01:29:38,641 --> 01:29:39,742
That's a neat robot,

2004
01:29:39,742 --> 01:29:41,076
but no, you can't
be on our show.

2005
01:29:41,076 --> 01:29:42,244
- Sorry.
- No, no, no, no.

2006
01:29:42,244 --> 01:29:44,079
Sorry, Jason
of the Salt Right of Fun.

2007
01:29:44,079 --> 01:29:46,081
That was weird.

2008
01:29:46,081 --> 01:29:48,751
Now this next one
